														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4141020">
									

<p>The author may have intended this to come across as bureaucratic tragedy, but, to this audience, it reads as straight-up authoritarian torture, combined with self-serving intellectually-vacuous justifications that get the people in charge what they want without having to do the heavy lifting of defending it to those they claim to serve and, explicitly, while avoiding the <strong>justifiably violent wrath</strong> of the latter and claiming a monopoly on violence.</p>
<p>Thus, I strongly disagree with the author’s take on their own material. This isn’t a mere bureaucratic snafu, but a straight-up fascist horrorscape.</p>
<p>I approve. +1.</p>
<p>The author is in <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7d6h3kaQs6g">good company</a>.</p>

